'''Kaoru Hanayama''' (花山薫, ''Hanayama Kaoru'', '''Kaoru Hanayama''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kaoru Hanayama
|image = E 726.png
|first appearance = [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like his Uber counterpart, Kaoru Hanayama is a brick wall of a unit with extremely high health and damage, but with a long foreswing. Hanayama also has several immunities, like Knockback, Weaken, Freeze, and Slow, disabling common methods of evading his attacks like the Breakerblast or Thunderbolt cannons, or [[Supercat]].

==Strategy==
Hanayama's main weakness, his foreswing, can be taken advantage of very easily with the default Cat Cannon, which will reset his attack animation. A dense spam of meatshields can wall Hanayama for ages, which gives your backliners free reign to chip him down.

